3

public domain means that there are no restrictions or requirements placed on use of
these datasets.

Section 6: Open Data Report and Review
a. The designated representative(s) will publish an annual Open Data Report. The report
shall include an assessment of progress towards achievement of the goals of the City’s
Open Data Policy.
b. The report will include suggestions for improving City open data management processes
to ensure movement towards policy goals.
